WEBVTT

00:18:58.700 --> 00:19:00.896
Her managers and coworkers from SAP

00:19:00.920 --> 00:19:04.086
were there to offer her support
every step of the way.

00:19:04.110 --> 00:19:06.156
FS: What didn't they do?

00:19:06.180 --> 00:19:11.326
The biggest thing that they did
was they reminded me that my job was safe.

00:19:11.350 --> 00:19:13.996
It was there when I was ready
to come back,

00:19:14.020 --> 00:19:17.256
and that all I needed to focus on
was my recovery.

00:19:17.280 --> 00:19:21.206
I can't even begin to explain
the burden it took off my shoulders.

00:19:21.230 --> 00:19:25.323
AG: After almost four long years
of recovery and rehabilitation,

00:19:25.347 --> 00:19:28.936
Felicia was finally able
to meet her goal and return to work.

00:19:28.960 --> 00:19:32.682
But there was still another dream
that she wanted to get back to.